{# Rendered with trim_blocks=True and lstrip_blocks=False.

   Convention: every control tag sits alone on its line and uses plain {% %}
   (never {%- -%}). With trim_blocks a lone block tag disappears completely, so
   the template reads like the Markdown it produces and blank lines are explicit.
   Markdown is whitespace-sensitive — bullet lists and headings need their own
   lines — so this discipline is load-bearing, not cosmetic. #}
